[gd_resource type="Theme" format=3]

; The buttons at night (user, 7 Nov 2026): black with white text and border. Put on the main
; screen by scripts/ui/main.gd while the sky is dark; everything else comes from main_theme.tres.
; The bars at night: the same, with white borders.

